## Quality Gates

### Pre-Commit Checklist
- [ ] All tests pass: `pytest`
- [ ] No linting errors: `pylint agent.py` or `flake8 agent.py`
- [ ] Type checking passes: `mypy agent.py`
- [ ] Coverage >90%: `pytest --cov=agent --cov-report=term`

### Coverage Requirements
```bash
# Run with coverage report
pytest --cov=agent --cov-report=html

# View HTML report
open htmlcov/index.html

# Fail if coverage < 90%
pytest --cov=agent --cov-fail-under=90
```

### Continuous Integration
```yaml
# Example GitHub Actions workflow
name: Tests
on: [push, pull_request]
jobs:
  test:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v3
      - uses: actions/setup-python@v4
        with:
          python-version: '3.10'
      - run: pip install -r requirements.txt
      - run: pytest --cov=agent --cov-fail-under=90
```

